      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This should be an option, as I am an animator creating hardstyle animations in VRChat for worlds and avatars. We need an option to flag animations, as I have epilepsy and many animations include screen effects, audio, particle prefabs, and even Doppel prefabs with shaders, which can be problematic.\n\nThis option should be a priority, as it is essential to support animators like myself. Without animators creating high-quality avatars and worlds, VRChat wouldn’t have grown as much as it has today. Removing or limiting these creative tools could cause animators to lose interest, which would negatively impact the platform's future.\n\ncan see my example im make but this option needs be featured adding so tupper if see this make this feature ASAP\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vQLYsfOt2EM - preview needs have filters in vrchat help people",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
